  "snippet": "cvc5 is an efficient open-source automatic theorem prover for Satisfiability Modulo Theories (SMT) problems. It can be used to prove the satisfiability (or, dually, the validity) of first-order formulas with respect to (combinations of) a variety of useful background theories…",
